OL,3,GNEWSATrains halted as lorry hits
OL,4,Arailway bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains have been stopped after a lorry
OL,7,Fhit and became wedged under a railway
OL,8,Fbridge in the New Forest.
OL,10,FThe lorry struck the bridge in
OL,11,FLymington on the A337 Southampton Road
OL,12,Fat about 07:50 BST.
OL,14,FSouth Western Railway said engineers
OL,15,Fwere on site examining the structure,
OL,16,Fwith buses replacing trains between
OL,17,FBrockenhurst and Lymington Pier.
OL,19,FDisruption is expected until the end of
OL,20,Fthe day, and passengers are being urged
OL,21,Fto check their journey and allow extra
OL,22,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
